Feature: Patcher UAT Clean Up
	Cleaning up any leftover data that the Patcher.prose test failed to remove. 
	This is purely a script to help remove Patcher UAT leftover data and should not be run on continuous integration testing. 
	It should only be run locally by QA testers who are cleaning up Patcher UAT.
	Disclaimer: This test only removes builds from the specified accounts listed in the test below. 
	Any new accounts that need to be cleaned up will need to be added to this script manually by the QA tester.
	Please commit all resulting changes.

Scenario: Clean up Patcher UAT
	Cleaning up any leftover data that the Patcher.prose test failed to remove

	* I log into the Patcher homepage as "test@liferay.com" with password "liferay"
	* I go to the Patcher homepage
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds and zendesk tickets on the account "INTUITIVE"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "STVINTRA"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "INDIANIOCLCM"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "BROADCINTRAN"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "DOEWAIKON"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "SOPRASGASXPO"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "HITACHIGP"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "FEDBANK"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "OPAPSAOPAPGR"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "INDIAPIPPBDX"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "EXCELLUS"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT conflict builds on the account "EXCELLUS" under the version "fix-pack-de-73-7010"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "AGORAMSA"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT conflict builds on the account "AGORAMSA" under the version "fix-pack-dxp-11-7110"
	* I tear down all Patcher UAT builds on the account "LRJAPANBASICACT"
